  data: {
    LLM: "Bid honestly: you need the Right Bower + 2 more sure tricks to bid 3. The Left Bower and an Ace of a side suit count as near-certain tricks.\n\nDealer's Advantage: The dealer must bid, so opponents to the dealer's right should push the bid to force the dealer into an uncomfortable contract.\n\nNo-Trump Bidding: A balanced hand with Aces in each suit is the ideal No-Trump hand. Signal your strength to partner through bidding levels.",
